<title>USA: Jacksonville, Fla., $51 mln set for sale Oct 21.</title>
<headline>Jacksonville, Fla., $51 mln set for sale Oct 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>JACKSONVILLE, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: 51,300,000</p>
<p>EXCISE TAX REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>WE PLAN TO PRICE THIS ISSUE MONDAY, OCTOBER 21, 1996.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Raymond, James &amp; Associates, Inc.</p>
<p>WR Lazard, Laidlaw &amp; Luther</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
